Subject: [PATCH] CLI: run with local Ollama models on Sharanga

- core/openrouter_client.py: model IDs "ollama/<name>" go to OLLAMA_BASE_URL
  (no key, 600 s timeout); everything else is unchanged.
- core/local_ollama.py (new, stdlib only): find, start, check, warm up and
  stop a local `ollama serve` on a per-job port.
- run_cli.py: interactive mode, --planner/--workers flags with short names,
  --list-models, auto-start of Ollama, per-run run.json, and --pull to fetch
  HPC runs into a laptop's workspaces/ and History.

